        "description": "__Height:__ 157 cm\n__School Year:__ Second Year\n\nA second-year student and high diver skilled enough to be on the national team. Likes business attire. Dreams of captaining her own ferry. You is a childhood friend of Chika, and became a school idol to help Chika with her dream.",
